│ failure patients from disparity communities", "abstract": "BACKGROUND The use of telemonitoring is a promising       │
│ approach to optimizing outcomes in the treatment of heart failure (HF) for patients living in the community. HF      │
│ telemonitoring interventions, however, have not been tested for use with individuals residing in disparity           │
│ communities. METHODS The current study describes the results of a community based participatory research approach to │
